Page {H 'APPENDIX A: SELECTED SOURCE TRACEABILITY';H 'A.1 Application Bootstrap' 2;T 'App.tsx composes SafeAreaProvider, ThemeProvider, useAuth, useOnlinePresence, FocusTimerProvider and NavigationContainer. This establishes the top-level order: theme is available before app rendering; authentication selects routes; timer state is available around the navigator.';H 'A.2 Todo Completion Rule' 2;T 'services/todos.ts defines COMPLETION_THRESHOLD as 0.8. addFocusSeconds reads the todo inside a Firestore transaction, adds elapsed seconds and marks it complete when a positive planned duration reaches the threshold. This is a client business rule that should be covered by transaction tests.';H 'A.3 Username Reservation' 2;T 'createInitialUserProfile coordinates userProfiles/{uid}, usernames/{lowercaseName} and users/{uid} through a transaction, avoiding an already-reserved candidate name.' }
